&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:4.5pt;"&gt; （うち１株当たり&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 中間配当額）&lt;/p&gt;
